{
  "schema_version": "1.0.0",
  "edition_id": "BSB",
  "book_code": "1CH",
  "chapter": 3,
  "verses": [
    {
      "id": "1CH.3.1",
      "edition_verse_id": "BSB:1CH.3.1",
      "verse": 1,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "These were the sons of David who were born to him in Hebron: The firstborn was Amnon by Ahinoam of Jezreel; the second was Daniel by Abigail of Carmel;",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "1CH.3.2",
      "edition_verse_id": "BSB:1CH.3.2",
      "verse": 2,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "the third was Absalom the son of Maacah daughter of King Talmai of Geshur; the fourth was Adonijah the son of Haggith;",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CH.3.3",
      "edition_verse_id": "BSB:1CH.3.3",
      "verse": 3,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "the fifth was Shephatiah by Abital; and the sixth was Ithream by his wife Eglah.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CH.3.4",
      "edition_verse_id": "BSB:1CH.3.4",
      "verse": 4,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "These six sons were born to David in Hebron, where he reigned seven years and six months. And David reigned in Jerusalem thirty-three years,",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CH.3.5",
      "edition_verse_id": "BSB:1CH.3.5",
      "verse": 5,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "and these sons were born to him in Jerusalem: Shimea, Shobab, Nathan, and Solomon. These four were born to him by Bathsheba daughter of Ammiel.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "1CH.3.6",
      "edition_verse_id": "BSB:1CH.3.6",
      "verse": 6,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "David’s other sons were Ibhar, Elishua, Eliphelet,",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CH.3.7",
      "edition_verse_id": "BSB:1CH.3.7",
      "verse": 7,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Nogah, Nepheg, Japhia,",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CH.3.8",
      "edition_verse_id": "BSB:1CH.3.8",
      "verse": 8,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Elishama, Eliada, and Eliphelet— nine in all.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CH.3.9",
      "edition_verse_id": "BSB:1CH.3.9",
      "verse": 9,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "These were all the sons of David, besides the sons by his concubines. And Tamar was their sister.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CH.3.10",
      "edition_verse_id": "BSB:1CH.3.10",
      "verse": 10,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Solomon’s son was Rehoboam: Abijah was his son, Asa his son, Jehoshaphat his son,",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CH.3.11",
      "edition_verse_id": "BSB:1CH.3.11",
      "verse": 11,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Joram his son, Ahaziah his son, Joash his son,",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CH.3.12",
      "edition_verse_id": "BSB:1CH.3.12",
      "verse": 12,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Amaziah his son, Azariah his son, Jotham his son,",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CH.3.13",
      "edition_verse_id": "BSB:1CH.3.13",
      "verse": 13,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Ahaz his son, Hezekiah his son, Manasseh his son,",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CH.3.14",
      "edition_verse_id": "BSB:1CH.3.14",
      "verse": 14,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Amon his son, and Josiah his son.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CH.3.15",
      "edition_verse_id": "BSB:1CH.3.15",
      "verse": 15,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "The sons of Josiah: Johanan was the firstborn, Jehoiakim the second, Zedekiah the third, and Shallum the fourth.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CH.3.16",
      "edition_verse_id": "BSB:1CH.3.16",
      "verse": 16,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "The successors of Jehoiakim: Jeconiah his son, and Zedekiah.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CH.3.17",
      "edition_verse_id": "BSB:1CH.3.17",
      "verse": 17,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "The descendants of Jeconiah the captive: Shealtiel his son,",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CH.3.18",
      "edition_verse_id": "BSB:1CH.3.18",
      "verse": 18,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Malchiram, Pedaiah, Shenazzar, Jekamiah, Hoshama, and Nedabiah.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CH.3.19",
      "edition_verse_id": "BSB:1CH.3.19",
      "verse": 19,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "The sons of Pedaiah: Zerubbabel and Shimei. The children of Zerubbabel: Meshullam and Hananiah, their sister Shelomith,",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CH.3.20",
      "edition_verse_id": "BSB:1CH.3.20",
      "verse": 20,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "and five others: Hashubah, Ohel, Berechiah, Hasadiah, and Jushab-hesed.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CH.3.21",
      "edition_verse_id": "BSB:1CH.3.21",
      "verse": 21,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "The descendants of Hananiah: Pelatiah, Jeshaiah, and the sons of Rephaiah, of Arnan, of Obadiah, and of Shecaniah.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CH.3.22",
      "edition_verse_id": "BSB:1CH.3.22",
      "verse": 22,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "The six descendants of Shecaniah were Shemaiah and his sons: Hattush, Igal, Bariah, Neariah, and Shaphat.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CH.3.23",
      "edition_verse_id": "BSB:1CH.3.23",
      "verse": 23,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "The sons of Neariah: Elioenai, Hizkiah, and Azrikam— three in all.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CH.3.24",
      "edition_verse_id": "BSB:1CH.3.24",
      "verse": 24,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "The sons of Elioenai: Hodaviah, Eliashib, Pelaiah, Akkub, Johanan, Delaiah, and Anani— seven in all.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    }
  ]
}
